            "review_title": "Review at Loan Mai",
            "review_text": "Lesia C\n3 contributions\n0\nRude lady!\nJul 2026 • Couples\nDisappointing. Waited for a while for a table, finally managed to find a seat. A nice Asian family sat down after us. After a while, the lady in the red dress took their order and ignored us. Eventually, we were given a menu that included noodles. When we asked for noodles, lady in red was quite rude and pointed at the rice menu. We didn't want rice, so due to her rude attitude, we got up and walked away. Obviously, this place is popular but seems to have forgotten how important customer service is. Wouldn't go back!\nRead more\nWritten July 18, 2026",
